display_name = "L6 · BROOD MOTHER"
briefing = "The heart of the nest. The thing that has been building all those
drones is waiting in the brood chamber, and it is not happy to see you.

It fires in spreads — keep moving sideways and the volleys will miss.
Drop it, then take the ring out before the nest wakes up."
